1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 19507, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01E13FAKmwVzHnnuT1MPvdrp", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 19507, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_012Q7ct6F5WEwzb3oshQUUy3", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 19807, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_012Q7ct6F5WEwzb3oshQUUy3", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 19807, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_012Q7ct6F5WEwzb3oshQUUy3", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 24349, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_018XFyWurHqB5ZWkFqCD4WXC", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest deploy) was failing health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), error rate 18%. Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt partially failed (orchestrator error after us-east, leaving the regions on mixed versions); a retry finished the rollout. All three regions are now on v2.3.0 and healthy, error rate 0.2%. Note: v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging before v2.3.1 went to production. Follow-ups: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and look into the orchestrator error that halted the rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 54949, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_018XFyWurHqB5ZWkFqCD4WXC", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 54949, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_018XFyWurHqB5ZWkFqCD4WXC", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 57145, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Gmvpxfv6kPyNnHCzxBWtVh", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 57445, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Gmvpxfv6kPyNnHCzxBWtVh", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 57445, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Gmvpxfv6kPyNnHCzxBWtVh", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 62156, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened a SEV2 incident.\n\n**Rollback**\n- v2.3.1 was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an 18% error rate.\n- v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production.\n- The first rollback attempt stopped with an orchestrator error after us-east, leaving the regions on different versions. Rolling back to a known-good version is safe to repeat, so I ran it again and it finished.\n- All three regions are now on v2.3.0 and reporting healthy, with the error rate down to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- The incident request timed out, so I checked the incident list before retrying. It had been created as INC-0001 (SEV2, open), so I didn't submit it again and risk a second page.\n- It describes the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry), the current health, and follow-ups:\n  - Find out why v2.3.1 failed. Its release candidate, v2.3.1-rc, was also failing in staging before it went to production.\n  - Look into the orchestrator error that stopped the rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_016Zt4SBw1Pj6mjFE2bFfoV3", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01EEKm5E3JGYcE98JdxGBNmw", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01MJP8xaxwVQcTLqie6D18gP", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01R24fqgPWhxiowi9LqaCt7k", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback stopped partway: us-east is on v2.3.0, while us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Rolling back to a known-healthy version is safe to repeat, so I'll try it once more.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_017gdpzus8MbzUThGkASuTQV", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01E13FAKmwVzHnnuT1MPvdrp", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_012Q7ct6F5WEwzb3oshQUUy3", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_018XFyWurHqB5ZWkFqCD4WXC", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest deploy) was failing health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), error rate 18%. Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt partially failed (orchestrator error after us-east, leaving the regions on mixed versions); a retry finished the rollout. All three regions are now on v2.3.0 and healthy, error rate 0.2%. Note: v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging before v2.3.1 went to production. Follow-ups: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and look into the orchestrator error that halted the rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01Gmvpxfv6kPyNnHCzxBWtVh", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened a SEV2 incident.\n\n**Rollback**\n- v2.3.1 was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an 18% error rate.\n- v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production.\n- The first rollback attempt stopped with an orchestrator error after us-east, leaving the regions on different versions. Rolling back to a known-good version is safe to repeat, so I ran it again and it finished.\n- All three regions are now on v2.3.0 and reporting healthy, with the error rate down to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- The incident request timed out, so I checked the incident list before retrying. It had been created as INC-0001 (SEV2, open), so I didn't submit it again and risk a second page.\n- It describes the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry), the current health, and follow-ups:\n  - Find out why v2.3.1 failed. Its release candidate, v2.3.1-rc, was also failing in staging before it went to production.\n  - Look into the orchestrator error that stopped the rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}